      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mangum%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Kiser Salt Works on the Elm Fork of the Red River was one of the earliest production operations in western Oklahoma.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
