      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mangum%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mangum's early economy relied heavily on large cattle ranches owned by companies from Texas and an English syndicate.",
